# Backfill opportunity test
# Job 0: Large job arrives first, needs 50 nodes, runs 200 seconds
50	0	200	0	batch	200
# Job 1: Small job arrives at 10, needs 10 nodes, runs 50 seconds
# Should backfill immediately since it finishes before Job 0
10	0	0	10	batch	50
# Job 2: Another large job, arrives at 20, needs 50 nodes, runs 100 seconds
# Cannot start until Job 0 finishes at 200
50	0	0	20	batch	100
# Job 3: Small job arrives at 30, needs 10 nodes, runs 30 seconds
# Should backfill after Job 1
10	0	0	30	batch	30
